DUSD::flashLoan
├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
└── given contract is not paused
    ├── when token is not this contract
    │   └── it should revert with ERC3156ExceededMaxLoan
    └── when token is this contract
        ├── when flashMintCap is zero
        │   ├── when value is greater than zero
        │   │   └── it should revert with ERC3156ExceededMaxLoan
        │   └── when value is equal to zero
        │       ├── it should call receiver onFlashLoan with zero
        │       └── it should return true
        └── when flashMintCap is set
            ├── when value exceeds flashMintCap
            │   └── it should revert with ERC3156ExceededMaxLoan
            └── when value is within flashMintCap
                ├── when receiver is not a valid flash borrower
                │   └── it should revert with ERC3156InvalidReceiver
                ├── when receiver returns invalid hash
                │   └── it should revert with ERC3156InvalidReceiver
                ├── when receiver does not approve repayment
                │   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance
                ├── when receiver has insufficient balance for repayment
                │   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
                ├── when flash fee is zero or flashFeeReceiver is zero
                │   ├── it should call onFlashLoan on flash borrower
                │   ├── it should not burn anything
                │   ├── dusd balance of flash borrower should not change
                │   └── it should return true
                ├── when flash fee is non-zero and flashFeeReceiver is set
                │   ├── it should call onFlashLoan on flash borrower
                │   ├── it should burn flash fee from flash borrower
                │   ├── it should transfer fee to flashFeeReceiver
                │   └── it should return true
                ├── when value is zero
                │   ├── it should call receiver onFlashLoan with zero
                │   └── it should return true
                └── when value equals flashMintCap
                    ├── it should call onFlashLoan on flash borrower
                    └── it should return true